#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0132 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "BASE != 0 is false, so the rule hands the case off to PMDA-AD0132A; independently the divide would yield NaN. Pins the deliberate hand-off."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col BASE    type=Num
col R2BASE  type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 10 | 0 | 5
---
